          "source": "SN51.20｜四種偏差",
          "sourceUrl": "https://agama.buddhason.org/SN/SN1561.htm",
          "originalText": "iti me chando na ca atilīno bhavissati, na ca atippaggahito bhavissati, na ca ajjhattaṃ saṃkhitto bhavissati, na ca bahiddhā vikkhitto bhavissati",
          "translationNote": "中文譯意：意欲不過低沉、不過高張、不向內緊縮、不向外散亂。經中分別解釋為懈怠、掉舉、惛沉睡眠，以及散逐外在五欲；亦適用精進、心、審察。",
